          "argument": "忘掉符号时移动局域仅影响 changing disc，加减 enclosed 圆与他处交换，故化为消解上两远鞍点交换，由 \\(m\\) 结合、\\(\\Delta\\) 余结合及 \\(\\Delta\\circ m=(m\\otimes id)(id\\otimes\\Delta)\\) 的拓扑解释即得交换性。"
        },
        {
          "id": "I_lemma52",
          "operationKind": "proof",
          "premises": [
            "C_prop31",
            "F_moviemoves",
